fix(controller): pace idle deepening sequentially

Replace the fixed setInterval with a setTimeout chain: the next
deepening round is scheduled only after all requests of the previous
round have returned. Cadence = previous round duration + idle interval,
so a slow local server never accumulates overlapping rounds. The
`deepening` re-entrancy flag is now unnecessary and removed.

- test: new case asserting round N+1 starts only after round N
  completed plus the idle interval (21 tests total).
- chore: origin now points at Hellfiredragon/flow-writer.
- docs: CLAUDE.md key design decision added for sequential pacing.
